fix(web,mobile): show dates and times in the device time zone

Decision deadlines, the Later return time, automation schedules and the
timestamps in copied error and crash reports rendered in UTC. A date-only
deadline now starts at local midnight, days count by the local calendar,
schedules convert to the device zone (adding their own zone when it
differs), and copied reports carry the device offset.

